  "solution": "**Given Equation: **(63 × 21) + 8 + 99 × 11 ÷ 16 + (12 × 4) = 158 \n\n**BODMAS Table:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each Option One by One:\n\nOption 1) + and -\n\n (63 × 21) + 8 + 99 × 11 ÷ 16 + (12 × 4) = 158 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n__**(63 × 21)**__ - 8 - 99 × 11 ÷ 16 - __**(12 × 4)**__ = 158\n\n1323 - 8 - 99 × __**11 ÷ 16 **__- 48 = 158 \n\n1323 - 8 - __**99 × 0.68**__ - 48 = 158\n\n1323 __**- 8 - 67.32 - 48**__ = 158\n\n__**1323 - 123.32**__ = 158\n\n1199.68 ≠ 158.\n\nOption 2) × and +\n\n(63 × 21) + 8 + 99 × 11 ÷ 16 + (12 × 4) = 158\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n__**(63 + 21)**__ × 8 × 99 + 11 ÷ 16 × __**(12 + 4)**__ = 158 \n\n84 × 8 × 99 + __**11 ÷ 16**__ × 16 = 158 \n\n__**84 × 8 × 99**__ + __**0.68 × 16**__ = 158\n\n__**66528 + 10.88 **__= 158\n\n66538.88 ≠ 158 \n\nOption 3) × and –\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get: \n\n(63 × 21) + 8 + 99 × 11 ÷ 16 + (12 × 4) = 158 \n\n__(63 - 21)__ + 8 + 99 - 11 ÷ 16 + __(12 - 4)__ = 158\n\n42 + 8 + 99 - __11 ÷ 16__ + 8 = 158\n\n__42 + 8 + 99 __- 0.68 __+ 8__ = 158\n\n__157 - 0.68__ = 158\n\n156.32 ≠ 158\n\nOption 4) ÷ and ×\n\n(63 × 21) + 8 + 99 × 11 ÷ 16 + (12 × 4) = 158 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n__**(63 ÷ 21)**__ + 8 + 99 ÷ 11 × 16 + __**(12 ÷ 4)**__ = 158\n\n3 + 8 + __**99 ÷ 11**__ × 16 + 3 = 158\n\n3 + 8 + __**9 × 16**__ + 3 = 158\n\n__**3 + 8 + 144 + 3**__ = 158\n\n__**158 = 158.**__ \n\nSo, by interchanging ÷ and ×, the equation becomes correct.\n\nHence, the correct answer is*** 'Option 4'.***",
